            "description": "Demonstrates the optional list filters validated by listBookingsQuerySchema (lib/validation/bookings.ts): `status` (must be a real BookingStatus value), `page`/`pageSize` (bounded, pageSize max 100). `startDate`/`endDate` filters are also supported but omitted here for brevity."
