            "description": "The pre-request script below clears the session_token cookie for {{baseUrl}} before sending, so this request works regardless of whether you're logged in from an earlier request -- reliably demonstrating the unauthenticated path. Expected: 401, `error.code = \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"`. NOTE: pm.cookies.jar().unset() requires a reasonably modern Postman version (desktop app, v9.9+ roughly) -- if your version doesn't support it, clear the `session_token` cookie manually via Postman's Cookies manager before running this request instead."
          },
          "response": []
